    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/d7467096c5ab969fc40395a7de7e67d9.poster.avif?t=1727954306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/d7467096c5ab969fc40395a7de7e67d9.webm?t=1727954306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Get ready for a dino-mite adventure! Derpy Dino is a 2D survival game where you play as a lovable, yet hapless dinosaur trying to survive in a world filled with danger. In Survival Mode, dodge falling meteors and see how long you can last. The timer will keep track of your progress. But that's not all! In the brand new Adventure Mode you can take on five levels filled with dangerous enemies and delicious fruits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/89ec574426321b40963712cc687a998e.poster.avif?t=1727954306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/89ec574426321b40963712cc687a998e.webm?t=1727954306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/e0c4f6dcfa7fb002355c816bd5d867e0.poster.avif?t=1727954306\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/e0c4f6dcfa7fb002355c816bd5d867e0.apng?t=1727954306\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/59ef467d193f03116495962381bea483.poster.avif?t=1727954306\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/59ef467d193f03116495962381bea483.webp?t=1727954306\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/a8b63230b13b52f7539f9d76343eb756.poster.avif?t=1727954306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/a8b63230b13b52f7539f9d76343eb756.webm?t=1727954306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>With its pixel art graphics and catchy chiptune soundtrack, Derpy Dino is a nostalgic treat for gamers of all ages. And with two exciting game modes to choose from, you'll never get bored. So grab your keyboard and mouse or controller, and get ready to join the Derpy Dino adventure! Can you survive the meteor showers and defeat the enemies to become the ultimate Derpy Dino champion?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/d7467096c5ab969fc40395a7de7e67d9.poster.avif?t=1727954306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/d7467096c5ab969fc40395a7de7e67d9.webm?t=1727954306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Get ready for a dino-mite adventure! Derpy Dino is a 2D survival game where you play as a lovable, yet hapless dinosaur trying to survive in a world filled with danger. In Survival Mode, dodge falling meteors and see how long you can last. The timer will keep track of your progress. But that's not all! In the brand new Adventure Mode you can take on five levels filled with dangerous enemies and delicious fruits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/89ec574426321b40963712cc687a998e.poster.avif?t=1727954306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/89ec574426321b40963712cc687a998e.webm?t=1727954306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/e0c4f6dcfa7fb002355c816bd5d867e0.poster.avif?t=1727954306\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/e0c4f6dcfa7fb002355c816bd5d867e0.apng?t=1727954306\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/59ef467d193f03116495962381bea483.poster.avif?t=1727954306\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/59ef467d193f03116495962381bea483.webp?t=1727954306\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/a8b63230b13b52f7539f9d76343eb756.poster.avif?t=1727954306\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387100/extras/a8b63230b13b52f7539f9d76343eb756.webm?t=1727954306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>With its pixel art graphics and catchy chiptune soundtrack, Derpy Dino is a nostalgic treat for gamers of all ages. And with two exciting game modes to choose from, you'll never get bored. So grab your keyboard and mouse or controller, and get ready to join the Derpy Dino adventure! Can you survive the meteor showers and defeat the enemies to become the ultimate Derpy Dino champion?",
    "short_description": "Unleash your primal roar! Conquer the different stages in Adventure Mode, where different enemies will try to stop you. Or test your limits in Endless Mode, where the sky is literally falling! Meteors are crashing down, and the action never stops. Can you beat your highscore?",
